OL,3,GNEWSAMan tells inquest he 'definitely'
OL,4,Adid not kill former partner
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe former partner of a woman whose
OL,7,Fbruised body was found in an
OL,8,Foverflowing bath has told an inquest
OL,9,Fthat he "definitely" did not kill her.
OL,11,FLaura Marshall was discovered dead in
OL,12,Fher home in Victoria Street in Lurgan
OL,13,Fon 3 April 2016.
OL,15,FTwo years after being arrested and
OL,16,Fcharged with her murder, all charges
OL,17,Fagainst Marshall's former partner, Gary
OL,18,FO'Dowd, were dropped.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,418,410,260,120,0,100
