OL,3,GNEWSAMan tells inquest he 'definitely'
OL,4,Adid not kill former partner
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Tuesday, O'Dowd previously contended
OL,7,Fhe had nothing to do with Marshall's
OL,8,Fdeath but friends of the deceased have
OL,9,Ftold the inquest she was worried he was
OL,10,Fgoing to kill her.
